# Compiled Python bytecode. The skill is distributed as source and runs from it;
# __pycache__ is a by-product of running the test suite, and the same modules get
# compiled once per interpreter version, so committing it means a diff every time
# anyone runs the tests on a different Python.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Archives built at the repository root. dist/claude-web/crecs-property-template.zip
# is deliberately NOT covered: it is a deliverable, and the package's own
# MANIFEST.sha256 lists it.
/*.zip

# OS junk
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
